      "text": "ONE LOCAL BACKEND — PORT 8000\n\nEntry: Extension_new/backend/main.py\nBrowser: /api/analyze/* | Financial: /verify\nPDF: /api/analyze/pdf | API docs: /docs\nOne address simplifies setup; shared process couples failures.",
