    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 768,
      "y": 981,
      "width": 634,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "IMPORTANT REMAINING WORK\n\nRevoke the exposed credential; add hosted authentication.\nAudit SSRF, dependencies and parser resource isolation.\nAPIF also defaults to 8000: resolve the service conflict.\nAdd CI and measure accuracy, false alarms and usability.\nSecurity review is partial, not compliance certification.",
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "orchestrator-20",
