    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 768,
      "y": 1256,
      "width": 634,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "OWASP RISKS 06–10 — PARTIAL COVERAGE\n\nASI06 Context poisoning: stale-result guards; corpus audit\nneeded.\nASI07 Agent communication: typed APIs; service identity needed.\nASI08 Cascading failures: limits/timeouts; circuit breakers\nneeded.\nASI09 Over-trust: evidence wording; usability tests needed.\nASI10 Rogue agents: no deployed agent; future controls needed.",
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "orchestrator-25",
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 26,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 26,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 0,
