      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OWASP RISKS 06–10 — PARTIAL COVERAGE\n\nASI06 Context poisoning: stale-result guards; corpus audit\nneeded.\nASI07 Agent communication: typed APIs; service identity needed.\nASI08 Cascading failures: limits/timeouts; circuit breakers\nneeded.\nASI09 Over-trust: evidence wording; usability tests needed.\nASI10 Rogue agents: no deployed agent; future controls needed.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1585,
      "width": 1340,
      "height": 85,
      "text": "SECURE REQUEST FLOW — EVERY ARROW IS A TRUST BOUNDARY\nCurrent checks + proposed policy controls. Detection does not authorize actions.\nBERT integration, crawler isolation and agent audit/kill switch remain proposed here.",
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "orchestrator-26",
      "angle": 0,
