      "originalText": "SECURE REQUEST FLOW — EVERY ARROW IS A TRUST BOUNDARY\nCurrent checks + proposed policy controls. Detection does not authorize actions.\nBERT integration, crawler isolation and agent audit/kill switch remain proposed here.",
