      "originalText": "INSTRUCTIONS ≠ CONTENT — ASI01 / ASI06\n\nCurrent: untrusted-input prompt boundaries and typed output.\nProposed: adversarial tests and authority-claim validation.\nCrawler/OCR output remains untrusted; prompts alone are weak.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
    {
