    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 758,
      "y": 2171,
      "width": 604,
      "height": 165,
      "text": "SUPPLY AND EXECUTION — ASI04 / ASI05\n\nCurrent: source/date records and signed contract metadata.\nProposed: dependency/model hashes, versions and evaluation.\nCrawler: validate → isolate → restrict → extract → destroy.\nAn isolated Playwright crawler is not verified by this\ndiagram.",
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "orchestrator-62",
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
