      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SUPPLY AND EXECUTION — ASI04 / ASI05\n\nCurrent: source/date records and signed contract metadata.\nProposed: dependency/model hashes, versions and evaluation.\nCrawler: validate → isolate → restrict → extract → destroy.\nAn isolated Playwright crawler is not verified by this\ndiagram.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
