      "originalText": "SERVICE MESSAGES — ASI07 / ASI08\n\nProposed schema: source, request ID, URL, status, signals.\nAuthenticate sender and integrity; reject stale/replayed\nresults.\nCurrent: schemas, timeouts and generation-based invalidation.\nUnavailable detectors reduce coverage, not evidence of risk.",
      "autoResize": false,
