      "originalText": "TRUST AND OVERSIGHT — ASI09 / ASI10\n\nCurrent: reasons, coverage and limited personal preferences.\nProposed audit: actor/request ID, input hash, tool, policy,\ntime.\nDetect unusual result patterns; add kill switch and review.\nDo not store raw sensitive content merely for audit purposes.",
